<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="calc-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/construction/">Construction</a>
      <span class="calc-breadcrumb__sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      Cash timeline
    </p>
    <span class="eyebrow">NSW house and land</span>
    <h1>Cash timeline</h1>
    <p class="lede">This cash timeline is only for two-contract NSW vacant land plus a fixed-price build. Estimate only. Not a loan offer.</p>
    <p>Reno, knock-down rebuild, or a finished home? Those are different doors. <a href="/construction/">Back to the construction hub</a>.</p>
  </div>
