<section class="section section--cool section--tight" data-hlc>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="calc-grid">

      <form class="calc-card calc-panel" id="hlc-form" novalidate>
        <p class="hlc-lock">Two contracts only: land, then a fixed-price build. Dated 2026/27. Estimate only.</p>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head">
            <label for="hlc-land">Vacant land price</label>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-affix">
            <input class="calc-input" id="hlc-land" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="500,000" aria-describedby="hlc-land-hint">
          </div>
          <p class="calc-field__hint" id="hlc-land-hint">NSW vacant land only. Not a completed or spec home.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head">
            <label for="hlc-build">Fixed-price build</label>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-affix">
            <input class="calc-input" id="hlc-build" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="600,000">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head">
            <label for="hlc-cash">Cash already in an Australian account</label>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-affix">
            <input class="calc-input" id="hlc-cash" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="107,000" aria-describedby="hlc-cash-hint">
          </div>
          <p class="calc-field__hint" id="hlc-cash-hint">Already here. Not KiwiSaver, not an unpaid bonus, not overseas money waiting to land.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head"><label>Are you both first-home buyers?</label></div>
          <div class="seg" id="hlc-fhb" role="group" aria-label="First-home buyers">
            <button type="button" data-value="yes" aria-pressed="true">Yes</button>
            <button type="button" data-value="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button>
          </div>
          <p class="calc-field__hint">Thresholds only. This is not an eligibility check. Assumes you qualify for FHBAS. Confirm on Revenue NSW before you exchange.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head"><label>Loan to value (LVR)</label></div>
          <div class="seg seg--wrap" id="hlc-lvr" role="group" aria-label="Loan to value ratio">
            <button type="button" data-value="70" aria-pressed="false">70%</button>
            <button type="button" data-value="80" aria-pressed="false">80%</button>
            <button type="button" data-value="90" aria-pressed="true">90%</button>
            <button type="button" data-value="95" aria-pressed="false">95%</button>
          </div>
          <p class="calc-field__hint">Default is 90%. Still changeable. This is not a max-loan calculator.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head">
            <label for="hlc-rate">Annual interest rate</label>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-affix calc-affix--suffix" data-suffix="%">
            <input class="calc-input calc-input--bare" id="hlc-rate" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="6.5" placeholder="Clear to skip repayments" aria-describedby="hlc-rate-hint">
          </div>
          <p class="calc-field__hint" id="hlc-rate-hint">Indicative only. Not your lender's rate. Change it. Clear the field to skip interest-only and principal-and-interest.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head">
            <label for="hlc-rent">Weekly rent while you wait</label>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-affix">
            <input class="calc-input" id="hlc-rent" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="0">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-field">
          <div class="calc-field__head">
            <label for="hlc-months">Months from land to practical completion</label>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-affix calc-affix--suffix" data-suffix="mo">
            <input class="calc-input calc-input--bare" id="hlc-months" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="12">
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="hlc-stages-note">Typical builder-contract stages (Housing Industry Association style) sit in the extra inputs below: deposit 5, base 10, frame 15, lock-up 35, fixing 25, practical completion 10. Overwrite them from the contract.</p>

        <details class="hlc-more" open>
          <summary>More inputs: holding deposit, extra cash, and stage percentages</summary>

          <div class="calc-field">
            <div class="calc-field__head">
              <label for="hlc-holding">Holding already paid</label>
            </div>
            <div class="calc-affix">
              <input class="calc-input" id="hlc-holding" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="0">
            </div>
            <p class="calc-field__hint">Already gone. Reduces the land invoice. Not subtracted from cash again.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="calc-field">
            <div class="calc-field__head">
              <label for="hlc-other">Other cash at land settlement</label>
            </div>
            <div class="calc-affix">
              <input class="calc-input" id="hlc-other" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="0">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="calc-field">
            <div class="calc-field__head">
              <label for="hlc-deposit">Builder deposit</label>
            </div>
            <div class="calc-affix calc-affix--suffix" data-suffix="%">
              <input class="calc-input calc-input--bare" id="hlc-deposit" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="5" aria-describedby="hlc-deposit-hint">
            </div>
            <p class="calc-field__hint" id="hlc-deposit-hint">A typical Housing Industry Association builder-contract figure is 5%. Home Building Act s8 maximum is 10%, not 5%. Overwrite from the contract.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="calc-field">
            <p class="calc-field__head"><label>Build stage percentages</label></p>
            <p class="calc-field__hint">Typical builder-contract split (Housing Industry Association style), not law. Must add to 100% with the deposit. Months default to an even split of the land-to-PC period.</p>
            <div class="hlc-stages" id="hlc-stages"></div>
            <p class="hlc-stage-sum" id="hlc-stage-sum"></p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </form>

      <div class="stack-lg">
        <div class="calc-card" id="hlc-result" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="calc-hero-stat">
            <span class="calc-hero-stat__label" id="hlc-hero-label">Cash after duty</span>
            <span class="calc-hero-stat__value" id="hlc-hero">-<//span>
            <p class="calc-hero-stat__note" id="hlc-hero-note"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-stats" id="hlc-stats"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-card" id="hlc-flags-card" hidden>
          <h3>Flags</h3>
          <ul class="hlc-flags" id="hlc-flags"></ul>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-card" id="hlc-duty-card" hidden>
          <h3>Duty on the land</h3>
          <div id="hlc-duty-body"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-card" id="hlc-walk-card" hidden>
          <h3>The cash timeline</h3>
          <p class="calc-field__hint">Own dollars go in first. After they are gone, later invoices are the lender paying the builder. Stage percentages are typical. Overwrite them from your contract.</p>
          <div class="hlc-table-wrap">
            <table class="hlc-table" id="hlc-walk">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="col">Step</th>
                  <th scope="col">Invoice</th>
                  <th scope="col">Your cheque</th>
                  <th scope="col">Lender draw</th>
                  <th scope="col">Drawn after</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-card" id="hlc-month-card" hidden>
          <h3>While you wait</h3>
          <p class="calc-field__hint" id="hlc-month-note"></p>
          <div class="hlc-table-wrap">
            <table class="hlc-table" id="hlc-month">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="col">Month</th>
                  <th scope="col">Drawn</th>
                  <th scope="col">Interest only</th>
                  <th scope="col">Rent</th>
                  <th scope="col">Cash that month</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="hlc-month-total" id="hlc-month-total"></p>
          <p class="hlc-pi" id="hlc-pi" hidden></p>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-card">
          <p class="hlc-savings" id="hlc-savings"></p>
          <div class="quiz-cta">
            {% cta "Book a Strategy Session" %}
            <p class="calc-field__hint">Thirty minutes on Google Meet. I will tell you if the cash at each stage actually works, including not yet.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="calc-assumptions" data-reveal>
      <details>
        <summary>The full rule list behind this tool</summary>
        <ul>
          <li>Estimate only. Dated 2026/27. Not an approval, not a max-loan, not a lender comparison, and not a borrow-o-meter.</li>
          <li>Two contracts: vacant NSW land, then a fixed-price build. Completed homes, spec homes, owner-builder, knock-down rebuilds and other states are out of scope.</li>
          <li>Package C is land plus build. Loan L is the floor of C times the LVR you pick. Equity E is C minus L. Duty sits on top of E. It is not part of the LVR.</li>
          <li>Duty uses the NSW 2026/27 land-transfer rates published by Revenue NSW (updated 19 August 2026). Dutiable value is the land price only. Premium duty over $3,870,000 is out of range here and is not computed. Transfer and LRS fees are not invented.</li>
          <li>First Home Buyers Assistance Scheme (vacant land): no duty at or under $350,000, full duty at or over $450,000. Between those two figures duty is concessional. This tool will not invent a sliding formula. Confirm on the official calculator. Assumes you qualify. Confirm on Revenue NSW before you exchange.</li>
          <li>First Home Owner Grant is $10,000 if you are a first-home buyer and the package is at or under $750,000, otherwise $0. The $0 line is shown on purpose. The grant is paid via the lender or Revenue NSW, not pocket cash on day one, so it does not add to the cash timeline.</li>
          <li>Lenders mortgage insurance is not computed. Genuine-savings seasoning is not tested. The tool only flags that 5% of the package is $X and that lenders usually want that already in Australia.</li>
          <li>Cash means money already in an Australian account. KiwiSaver, unpaid bonus and overseas money do not count.</li>
          <li>Default build stages are a typical builder-contract split (Housing Industry Association style, not law): deposit 5, base 10, frame 15, lock-up 35, fixing 25, practical completion 10. Overwrite them from the contract. Home Building Act s8 caps the deposit at 10%.</li>
          <li>At land settlement you put in the required equity first. Extra cash stays as a buffer for later build invoices. After your own dollars are gone, later invoices are the lender paying the builder.</li>
          <li>Interest-only while you wait is drawn balance times the rate you typed, divided by 12. Rent runs until practical completion. After practical completion, a simple 30-year principal-and-interest estimate on the full drawn balance. No APRA 3% buffer.</li>
          <li>Product features change. This is general information, not personal advice.</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </div>

    <p class="hlc-sources">
      Sources:
      <a href="https://www.revenue.nsw.gov.au/taxes-duties-levies-royalties/transfer-duty" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Revenue NSW transfer duty</a>,
      <a href="https://www.revenue.nsw.gov.au/grants-schemes/first-home-buyer/assistance-scheme" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FHBAS</a>,
      <a href="https://apps09.revenue.nsw.gov.au/erevenue/calculators/fhba.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FHBAS vacant-land calculator</a>,
      <a href="https://www.revenue.nsw.gov.au/grants-schemes/first-home-buyer/new-homes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">First Home Owner Grant</a>,
      <a href="https://legislation.nsw.gov.au/view/html/inforce/current/act-1989-147#sec.8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Home Building Act s8</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

